WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.961 --> 00:00:14.721
cowboy leaned toward them.

2
00:00:15.922 --> 00:00:20.944
A little afraid, Vinnie and Mandy moved to the other side of the wagon.

3
00:00:20.964 --> 00:00:26.766
"Come on out of there," he said in a firm but friendly voice.

4
00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:30.368
The children crawled forward and looked out.

5
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.642
"Wow!" Vinnie said loudly.

6
00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.204
A large herd of cattle was nearby.

7
00:00:39.504 --> 00:00:42.646
Vinnie counted about ten cowboys riding horses.

8
00:00:44.087 --> 00:00:46.568
The children started to climb out of the wagon.

9
00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.890
"Where are we?

10
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:53.172
Oops!" cried Mandy, almost falling off the wagon.

11
00:00:53.192 --> 00:00:57.735
"Careful now, little one," the cowboy laughed.

12
00:00:57.755 --> 00:01:00.176
"We left Texas quite a while ago.

13
00:01:01.132 --> 00:01:03.174
We're in Kansas, on the Chisholm Trail."

14
00:01:03.194 --> 00:01:06.256
"Kansas?" cried Vinnie.

15
00:01:06.276 --> 00:01:09.138
"How did you two get in my wagon?"

16
00:01:10.419 --> 00:01:11.359
asked the cowboy.

17
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:16.063
"Actually, we stuttered Vinnie.

18
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:19.786
"We wanted to go on an adventure!"

19
00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:21.427
Mandy interrupted.

20
00:01:22.628 --> 00:01:24.849
The cowboy smiled and shook his head.

21
00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:28.452
"You'll get adventure, all right.

22
00:01:29.536 --> 00:01:31.118
But this trail can be dangerous."

23
00:01:32.319 --> 00:01:38.804
The children introduced themselves, and Mandy said, "We promise not to bother you.

24
00:01:39.485 --> 00:01:40.465
Can we stay?"

25
00:01:40.486 --> 00:01:42.807
"Hey, Cookie!

26
00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:43.728
When's supper?"

27
00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.231
a young cowboy called to the man.

28
00:01:47.251 --> 00:01:51.235
"Wait a minute, my friend," Cookie shouted back.

29
00:01:52.636 --> 00:01:54.177
Then he turned to the children.

30
00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:57.240
"I'll talk to the boss to see if you can stay.

31
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.302
Meanwhile, you can help me cook."

32
00:02:01.403 --> 00:02:05.486
Cookie asked the children to unload a frying pan and a large pot.

33
00:02:06.647 --> 00:02:12.131
Then, as Cookie picked up a sack of beans, another cowboy walked over.

34
00:02:12.151 --> 00:02:14.633
"Who are these kids?"

35
00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:15.814
he said.

36
00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:22.880
"They're Vinnie and Mandy, and they're on a big adventure," chuckled Cookie.

37
00:02:23.961 --> 00:02:25.502
He winked at the other man.

38
00:02:25.522 --> 00:02:27.844
"This is Frank, children.

39
00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:29.449
He's the trail boss."

40
00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.752
"That's right," said Frank sternly.

41
00:02:33.772 --> 00:02:35.873
"Come with me, Vinnie.

42
00:02:36.314 --> 00:02:37.434
I can use your help."

43
00:02:38.655 --> 00:02:39.936
Vinnie followed Frank.

44
00:02:41.277 --> 00:02:43.358
Mandy stayed behind to help Cookie.

45
00:02:43.378 --> 00:02:45.840
"What are we going to do?"

46
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.141
asked Vinnie.

47
00:02:48.142 --> 00:02:51.144
Frank untied two horses from a nearby bush.

48
00:02:51.164 --> 00:02:57.228
"We need to move the herd," explained Frank, getting on one horse.

49
00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.281
"Just follow me."

50
00:02:59.301 --> 00:03:04.885
Frank made a clicking noise with his tongue and then rode off.

51
00:03:07.106 --> 00:03:10.168
Nervously, Vinnie climbed onto the other horse.

52
00:03:10.188 --> 00:03:14.351
"Good horse," he said softly.

53
00:03:15.572 --> 00:03:16.953
The horse didn't move.

54
00:03:18.214 --> 00:03:21.016
Vinnie tried making the clicking noise like Frank.

55
00:03:22.177 --> 00:03:26.220
But his horse just lowered its head and ate some grass.

56
00:03:28.176 --> 00:03:34.139
Vinnie watched Frank circle the cattle, going in and out of the herd.

57
00:03:34.619 --> 00:03:37.200
He shouted and snapped a whip in the air.

58
00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:41.622
"Please, do something," Vinnie said to his horse.

59
00:03:41.642 --> 00:03:44.323
"First time on a horse?"

60
00:03:45.003 --> 00:03:46.684
asked Frank, riding over.

61
00:03:46.704 --> 00:03:49.445
"Yes, sir," said Vinnie.

62
00:03:49.465 --> 00:03:53.527
"Our horses know their job," said Frank.

63
00:03:54.687 --> 00:03:56.768
"But you need to show them who's boss."

64
00:03:58.156 --> 00:04:03.500
Frank showed Vinnie how to hold the reins and lightly kick with his heels.

65
00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:07.343
"Now, give it a try," ordered Frank.

66
00:04:07.363 --> 00:04:09.084
"Come on, horse!"

67
00:04:10.205 --> 00:04:12.126
Vinnie shouted in a strong voice.

68
00:04:13.427 --> 00:04:15.529
The horse moved slowly forward.

69
00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.212
Vinnie held on as tight as he could.
